<h2 data-node-id="I857:15235;750:726;748:552" class="c-heading" data-part="heading">Take the whole property</h2>
<p data-part="paragraph">Thirty-three guests, fourteen units, the Dome, the kitchen and 118 acres, with nobody else on the land. You run your programme. We run everything around it: rooms, food, sound, transport and staff. Most groups stay three to five days.</p>
<div data-part="actions"><a data-name="CTA" data-node-id="I857:15235;750:726;750:1289;750:1257" class="current-action" data-part="action" href="{base}/{edition}/retreats/">PLAN A RETREAT</a><a data-name="Link arrow button" data-node-id="I857:15235;750:726;750:1289;750:1256" class="current-action" data-part="action" href="{base}/{edition}/groups-and-offsites/">INQUIRE ABOUT A GROUP</a></div></div></section>
<section data-name="Section - 50/50 text image" data-node-id="857:15236" data-role="split" data-layout="copy-first" data-variant="editorial"><div data-part="copy"><p data-node-id="I857:15236;748:575;748:551" data-part="eyebrow">la fortuna, costa rica</p>
<h2 data-node-id="I857:15236;748:575;748:552" class="c-heading" data-part="heading">Where you{' '}actually are</h2>
<p data-part="paragraph">Arenal is a volcano, a lake, hot springs, waterfalls and a town called La Fortuna at the foot of all of it. Most people fly into San José and drive [hours]. We have written the practical version of the whole valley: how to get here, what is worth a day, and which months are worth paying more for.</p>
